<mxCell id="n7" value="Lock 1: the controller sets ro: true,&#10;and the configuration has no field&#10;that makes a mount writable.&#10;It refuses .., :, /, and a URL." style="text=1;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1f2328;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;strokeColor=#d0d7de;fillColor=#f6f8fa;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="70" width="300" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n8" value="Lock 2: Orchard refuses a path that no&#10;policy allows, and a mount that is not&#10;read-only. Each policy is one exact path." style="text=1;html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1f2328;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;strokeColor=#d0d7de;fillColor=#f6f8fa;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="190" width="300" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
